{
  "_comment": [
    "Two independent axes, deliberately not the same flag:",
    "  is_optional  — may fail without failing the release (continue-on-error).",
    "  publish_wave — 'primary' ships in the first publish; 'backfill' ships in",
    "                 a second publish after the channel is already promoted.",
    "Only put a platform in the backfill wave when it is genuinely slower than",
    "the required critical path. Measured over v0.3.70-v0.3.73, macOS Intel took",
    "33-63 min against a 25-31 min required path, while Linux and Windows 32-bit",
    "finished before the first publish started in every one of those releases."
